
---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="About">

  <main class="about-page">

    <!-- PAGE INTRO -->
    <section class="page-intro">
      <span class="section-label">ZAGAMUN 2026</span>
      <h1>About Gonzaga College MUN</h1>
      <div class="title-divider"></div>
    </section>

    <!-- OPENING STATEMENT -->
    <section class="opening-section">
      <p>
        Five hundred years ago, the Jesuit order thought of, wrote about,
        and argued for an idea. The concept that a special emphasis on
        rhetoric, humanity, and leadership, in the education of the young
        today, would have a profoundly beneficial effect on the society
        of tomorrow. Five centuries later, the ideas and thoughts born
        from this aspiration, still continue to reshape our world.
        Five centuries later, the ability to think independently, to
        speak one’s mind clearly, and concisely, and to successfully work
        with those around you, is still a hallmark of leadership, and
        leaders with the willingness to do what is right.
      </p>
    </section>

    <!-- CONFERENCE INFORMATION -->
    <section class="about-section">

      <div class="about-content">

        <h2>Our Conference</h2>

        <div class="title-divider"></div>

        <p>
          It is our enduring hope, that ZAGAMUN may flourish as a home
          of independent thought and collaboration. Particularly in
          an ever more unstable, unpredictable world, that seems to
          value the ability to compromise and collaborate less and less.
          So, here is how we work:
        </p>

        <p>
          ZAGAMUN is a Model United Nations conference, based in and run
          by the students and staff of Gonzaga College SJ. We welcome
          schools from all across Leinster, to productively debate on
          the most pressing topics of the world today. We consider
          ourself a home to both the experienced, and the first-time
          delegate. And hope for a bit of fun, and friendship building
          along the way. This is why on behalf of the ZAGAMUN team,
          we ask for the utmost respect from everyone, for everyone.
        </p>

      </div>

      <div class="about-image">
        <img
          src="/about.jpg"
          alt="Delegates at a Model United Nations conference"
        />
      </div>

    </section>

    <!-- CLOSING STATEMENT -->
    <section class="closing-section">

      <div class="closing-divider"></div>

      <p>
        Because ideas, politely and articulately expressed,
        can change the world.
      </p>

      <div class="closing-divider"></div>

    </section>

    <div class="about-footnote">
  Written by Conor Sheahan - Student of Gonzaga College SJ
</div>

  </main>

</Layout>

<style>

  /* PAGE */
  .about-page {
    width: 94%;
    max-width: 1350px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 5rem 0 6rem;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  /* PAGE INTRO */
  .page-intro {
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .section-label {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: bold;
    letter-spacing: 3px;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .page-intro h1 {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 2.8rem);
    line-height: 1.2;
    margin: 0.5rem 0 0;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .title-divider {
    width: 65px;
    height: 3px;
    background: #ffffff;
    margin: 1.5rem 0;
    border-radius: 5px;
  }

  /* OPENING STATEMENT */
  .opening-section {
  max-width: 1200px;
  width: 100%;
  box-sizing: border-box;
  margin: 0 auto 3.5rem;
  padding: 2rem 2.5rem;
  background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.06);
  border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
  border-radius: 16px;
}

  .opening-section p {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    line-height: 1.9;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* MAIN CONTENT */
  .about-section {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
    gap: 3.5rem;
    align-items: start;
    padding: 1rem 0;
  }

  /* TEXT */
  .about-content h2 {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.5vw, 2rem);
    line-height: 1.3;
    margin: 0.7rem 0 0;
    color: #ffffff;
  }

  .about-content p {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    line-height: 1.85;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
    margin: 0 0 1.3rem;
  }

  /* IMAGE */
 .about-image {
  width: 100%;
  aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
  overflow: hidden;
  border-radius: 16px;
  align-self: start;
}

  .about-image img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    display: block;
  }

  /* CLOSING STATEMENT */
  .closing-section {
    
    max-width: 850px;
    margin: 4rem auto 0;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 2rem 1rem;
  }

  .closing-divider {
    width: 65px;
    height: 2px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
    margin: 0 auto 2rem;
    border-radius: 5px;
  }

  .closing-section p {
    font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2.2rem);
    line-height: 1.5;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #ffffff;
    margin: 0 0 2rem;
  }

  .about-footnote {
  font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
  margin-top: 2rem;
  text-align: center;
  font-size: 0.8rem;
  color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.55);
  letter-spacing: 0.3px;
}

  /* TABLET */
  @media (max-width: 850px) {

    .about-section {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }

    .about-image {
      aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    }

  }

  /* MOBILE */
  @media (max-width: 650px) {

    .about-page {
      width: 90%;
      padding: 3rem 0 4rem;
    }

    .page-intro h1 {
      font-size: 2rem;
    }

    .opening-section {
      padding: 1.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    }

    .opening-section p {
      font-size: 1rem;
    }

    .about-section {
      gap: 1.5rem;
    }

    .about-image {
      aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
    }

    .closing-section {
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }

  }

</style>
</Layout>
